body.p:
The Examiner indicates that the specification is objected to because of the use of the term"Wi-Fi," which is a trade name or a mark used in commerce, without a proper symbol such as  SVG
{EMBED HERE}
0.140.197 SM, or ® following the term. To obviate this objection, paragraphs 0022, 0023, and 0081 of the application-as-filed are amended to replace the term "Wi-Fi" with --Wi-Fi*--.
